      "message": "Looking back at the discussion in [this thread](https://review.gerrithub.io/c/eclipse-jgit/jgit/+/194140/comment/ecdead47_21234d73/), it wasn\u0027t clear how many commits are typically added to the queue. If most usage is \u003c1000 commits, then using `DateRevPriorityQueue` could be a regression overall, unless there are also enough \u003e1000 commit use cases that the significant speedup there is worthwhile.",
